951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. March to April came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle saw August to September at 45% of normal and September to October at 47%. So far in 2026, May to June ran 185% of normal there, and grid 12158 shows a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 65.7.</p>"}
